t-dependent"]}, {"id": "goldfinancetalkingmoneyp_34", "type": "choice", "label": "How often do you translate reflection into concrete next steps?", "options": ["Often", "Sometimes", "Rarely", "I resist planning", "I over-plan"]}, {"id": "goldfinancetalkingmoneyp_35", "type": "choice", "label": "Final calibration: how representative do you think your answers are of people in situations very different from yours?", "options": ["Very representative", "Somewhat", "Not very", "I doubt it", "I actively don’t know"]}]$json$::jsonb,
